Icons-Only Task Manager with Spacers is a fork of KDE Plasma's task manager.

The applet and new fork code are licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later. Individual
inherited files retain their original SPDX notices, including
LGPL-2.0-or-later notices. Original KDE copyright notices are retained.

